# DissolutionReceipt schema (reachability-lapse dissolution)
# Record-judgment reading (premath.record-judgments.v0): this schema
# file is a COMPILED ARTIFACT per RJ-1.6 — the statement is the type,
# this file is data, never executable authority. Directive law map:
# require = telescope extension premise (RJ-1.1 shape);
# enum / literal / enum_prefix = atomic-predicate membership (RJ-1.5).
header DissolutionReceipt
require receipt_id
require cycle_id
require cargo
require prior_admission_receipt_ref
require reachability_criterion
require lapse_evidence
require authority_surface
require predicate
require threshold_outcome
require recorder
require receipt_ref
literal threshold_outcome admit
enum reachability_criterion compact-expiry purpose-detachment source-withdrawal successor-replacement
